# playSelectSound(Player player)
# Plays the "piece selected" sound for everyone within 20 blocks of
# the chess board. CHANGE the sound name below to your preferred
# sound effect; the rest (source category, target selector, position,
# volume, pitch) stays the same across all six sound helpers.

@using rychess
@fast

@bypass /playsound minecraft:ui.button.click master @a[x=-9134.0,y=-61.0,z=9669.0,distance=..20] -9134.0 -61.0 9669.0 1 1
